  "grade_presets_note": "engine = the in-engine film look for code-rendered 3D (faceless deep-dive/night-file/tall-tale): tone map, LUT (assets/luts, make_luts.py), lut_mix, halation 0..1, ca px. faceless.py writes it to faceless/look.json. Remotion's tint is scaled by in_engine_tint_scale when every shot is code-rendered. Tone map: ACES + LUT tested best on deep-dive sets (2026-11-28); AgX came out flat and muddy, so use it only per video via visual_plan.film {\"tonemap\": \"agx\"} for scenes with blown saturated lights.",
